# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# What is shared, and why
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The repository is deliberately small (~2 MB against ~270 MB on disk). It
# carries the scenario definition, the code, and the result tables needed to
# reproduce every number in FINDINGS.md — and nothing else. Anything a script
# regenerates is excluded.
#
# Deliberately kept:
#   sumo/net, sumo/routes, sumo/add, sumo/simulation2.sumocfg  the scenario
#   model/ control/ validation/ calibration/                   the code
#   data/*.json, data/sumo_baseline.npz                        results + fixed baseline
#   experiments/exp{A,B}*/{core,bmetanet}.py + params          parity-test references
#   FINDINGS.md, README.md                                     what was found, how to run it
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# --- SUMO run output: hundreds of MB, regenerated by every run --------------
# sumo/out/ holds per-run emissions and SSM (safety) files, one pair per run.
sumo/out/
sumo/output/
sumo/*.xml
!sumo/net/*.xml
!sumo/routes/*.xml
# sumo/add/ mixes a small config file with the emissions output it produces
sumo/add/edge_emissions.xml
!sumo/add/emissions_meandata.xml

# Floating-car-data dumps: ~50 MB each, written by the validation scripts
*fcd*.xml
data/*.xml

# --- data/: keep the small result tables, drop the big regenerable arrays ---
# The .json result tables and sumo_baseline.npz (the FIXED ground-truth
# baseline, never to be regenerated) are tracked. Everything else here is a
# cache written by a script and is excluded by size.
data/*.npz
!data/sumo_baseline.npz
data/*.npy

# --- working notes, not part of the shared record --------------------------
# docs/ is the day-to-day research log, decision history and figure output.
# FINDINGS.md at the repo root is the shared summary that replaces it.
docs/

# --- the model bake-off ----------------------------------------------------
# ~470 files of calibration runs. Only the two reference implementations the
# parity tests import are kept, so validation/test_*_parity.py still runs.
experiments/
# fixed_vsl.py is NOT bake-off code: it produces the constant-sign reference
# that every result is reported against (FINDINGS.md section 2). It lives here
# for historical reasons only.
!experiments/fixed_vsl.py
!experiments/expA_asym_antic/
experiments/expA_asym_antic/*
!experiments/expA_asym_antic/core.py
!experiments/expA_asym_antic/params_s14_smooth_tau18.json
!experiments/expB_bounded/
experiments/expB_bounded/*
!experiments/expB_bounded/bmetanet.py
!experiments/expB_bounded/params_pub_pred.json

# superseded code kept locally for reference only
old/

# Claude Code's operating manual: personal AI tooling, and it points at docs/,
# which is not shared. Kept locally, not part of the shared record.
CLAUDE.md
